    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξυπν-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνος</span>)
